# Arc's Settings ▸ Advanced "When opening Arc, restore windows from previous session" (Arc 1.172.1,
# docs/arc-parity.md), turned off: after a relaunch only the window in use last comes back.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false, "restoreWindows": false}
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=one
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://action/newWindow
wait 2
cra://debug?browserWindows=before
expect-log browser windows before: count=2
relaunch
wait 4
cra://debug?browserWindows=after
expect-log browser windows after: count=1
